  hermitdave/FrequencyWords, from the OpenSubtitles 2018 corpus via OPUS
  MIT

Validation
  vi.wiktionary.org page titles (CC-BY-SA-4.0) — vi.wiktionary.org contributors, page titles in namespace 0

